-- Class/subclass features catalog, from the user's homebrew features-tracking sheet.
-- Currently covers Ace trainer and Researcher's class trees only (~205 rows) --
-- Breeder/Coordinator/Ranger features aren't in the source sheet yet.
--
-- ASSUMPTION: rows listing the bare class "Type ace" (no type specified, e.g. "Type
-- ace (fire)") apply at the Ace trainer class level with no specific subclass_id,
-- since our subclasses table has 9 separate Type ace (<type>) rows and the source
-- data doesn't specify which type variant these particular features belong to.
on conflict (name, class_id, subclass_id, level_required) do nothing;
